"Senva seed looks like a tangled dandelion and smells of basil."
"It is an ingredient for the cushioning spell, which then feels like a slowly sinking marshmallow."
"It is given as a pocket offering, which can go stale."
"One seed makes one cushioning spell; senva is not rare."
"A pocket offering is spell ingredients given to a wizard in a pouch showing the gratitude logogram."
"Its words: 'For the gift of your magic. Please take what you need today and what may be wanted tomorrow.'"
